OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC40th anniversary of the "TWO"
OL,4,Cident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA delightful article in this week's
OL,7,FRadio Times will have been an
OL,8,Funexpected surprise for Pres fans.
OL,10,FIt explores the design and evolution of
OL,11,FBBC Two's idents in recent decades.
OL,13,FThe reason for its publication this
OL,14,Fweek was a lovely surprise too.
OL,16,FAlan Jeapes "TWO" branding appeared on
OL,17,F30th March 1986 ` Easter Sunday.
OL,19,FIt is thought the new package was
OL,20,Fintroduced in the early evening rather
OL,21,Fthan at the start of the day's
OL,22,Fprogrammes.
OL,23,APub: 29-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,124,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F123A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC40th anniversary of the "TWO"
OL,4,Cident
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Jeapes was a distinguished BBC
OL,7,Fdesigner.
OL,9,FHis work had an elegance and apparent
OL,10,Fsimplicity which now makes much of his
OL,11,Fwork seem almost timeless.
OL,13,FThe titles for the wartime drama Secret
OL,14,FArmy are a particular favourite of
OL,15,Fmine.
OL,17,FThe simple use of a series of still
OL,18,Fphotographs with a slight zoom into
OL,19,Feach is memorable and effective `
OL,20,Fespecially when combined with Robert
OL,21,FFarnon's dramatic music.
OL,23,APub: 29-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,124,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12303
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F123A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC40th anniversary of the "TWO"
OL,4,Cident
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeapes designed the original titles for
OL,7,FEastEnders ` the stylised blue Thames
OL,8,Fagainst a monochrome aerial picture of
OL,9,Fthe East End. It created a powerful
OL,10,Fvisual image for the programme and his
OL,11,Fconcept provides the basis for the
OL,12,Fmodern titles.
OL,14,FHis titles for Eldorado were one of the
OL,15,Ffew good things about that dreadful
OL,16,Ffiasco.
OL,18,FThat same simplicity and elegance can
OL,19,Fbe seen in the TWO logo and ident.
OL,21,FThere is much to be said in its favour.
OL,23,APub: 29-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,124,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12304
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F123A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC40th anniversary of the "TWO"
OL,4,Cident
OL,5,
OL,6,FBy 1986, the revolutionary
OL,7,Felectronically generated ident
OL,8,Fintroduced in 1979 was starting to look
OL,9,Fdated.
OL,11,FBranding the channel with the word TWO
OL,12,Frather than the numeral 2 was an
OL,13,Finnovative concept.
OL,15,FIt helped ensure the logo was clearly
OL,16,Fdifferent to Channel 4's.
OL,18,FIt was also unusual to build a graphic
OL,19,Fident against a white background. The
OL,20,Fcustom and convention was to use black
OL,21,For dark blue.
OL,23,APub: 29-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,124,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12305
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F123A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC40th anniversary of the "TWO"
OL,4,Cident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe simple way the ident animated off
OL,7,Fand on the screen was also proof that
OL,8,Fless can be more.
OL,10,FYet for all of this, I'm not sure if
OL,11,Fthis design really worked as a
OL,12,Fpresentation package.
OL,14,FIt failed to address the fundamental
OL,15,Fproblems BBC Two had always faced.
OL,17,FNone of the channel's previous idents
OL,18,Fhad really said anything about the
OL,19,Fchannel's character nor did this one.
OL,23,APub: 29-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,124,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12306
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F123A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC40th anniversary of the "TWO"
OL,4,Cident
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Two often seemed simply to provide
OL,7,Feverything and anything which couldn't
OL,8,Fgo on BBC One. Its identity seemed to
OL,9,Fbe defined by not being its big brother
OL,10,F` it didn't have a proper visual or
OL,11,Fbrand identity of its own.
OL,13,FThe irony is that two years after this
OL,14,Fpackage was introduced, BBC Two gained
OL,15,Fa controller with a love of design.
OL,17,FAlan Yentob was not a fan of the TWO
OL,18,Fpackage. During his time in charge,
OL,19,FLambie-Nairn's revolutionary idents
OL,20,Ffinally gave BBC Two a proper positive
OL,21,Fidentity.
OL,23,APub: 29-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,124,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12307
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F123A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESC40th anniversary of the "TWO"
OL,4,Cident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn hindsight, the TWO ident can be seen
OL,7,Fas the last in the series of idents
OL,8,Fwhich had attempted to define BBC Two
OL,9,Fsince 1964. Simply being more informal
OL,10,Fthan BBC One and minimising or
OL,11,Fcompletely avoiding explicit BBC
OL,12,Fbranding seemed enough.
OL,14,FWhile I'm no fan of this logo as an
OL,15,Fident, as a piece of design it is quite
OL,16,Fbeautiful. And it shares the qualities
OL,17,Fof the outstanding work by Alan Jeapes
OL,18,Fwhich enhanced so many programmes.
OL,23,APub: 29-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,124,120,200,300,0,100@
